            True to Zip Solutions' core mission, the Picture-in-Picture update is available to all users on the free tier of Zip Captions, working seamlessly alongside both standard browser speech recognition and the platform's optional Azure AI-powered captioning engine. As with all Zip Captions sessions, audio is never recorded, and transcripts remain stored privately in the user's local browser memory.
          </p>

